  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a South-South cooperation initiative on payments for environmental services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will facilitate country collaboration and co-construction of payment for environmental services (PES) schemes for the protection and sustainable management of their tropical forests. The initial countries to be engaged are Cameroon, Costa Rica, Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC), Gabon, Central African Republic , and the Republic of Congo.</narrative>
  </description>
